Server init.
>> a := Blob ġdid: 4.
a bytes: ( Lista ġdid ; Bin b00000101 ; Hx x0A ; Bin b10000001 ; 0).
>> b := Blob ġdid: 4.
b bytes: ( Lista ġdid ; Bin b00000110 ; Hx x0A ; Bin b10000000 ; 0).
# inherited blob does not get the buffer, so it's useless
# it will pass ctr_accept() but since buffer ptr == null, it will retur
>> c := a ġdid.
{ 
>> n := a ^ c.
Ħruġ ikteb: ['xorred:'], linja-ġdida. 
Ħruġ ikteb: n, linja-ġdida. 
} aqbad: { :e Ħruġ ikteb: e, linja-ġdida. }, ibda.
a eħles.
b eħles.
